title: "Switchboard: Provider Request Mutations"
status: draft
created: 2026-10-15
author: adrian
items[10]{id,title,description,criteria,complexity,effort,dependencies,refs}:
  T-001,[x] Create agentkit-script crate and Limits,"Add crates/agentkit-script to the workspace with Cargo.toml (rhai 1.26 with serde, sync, no_module, no_closure, no_time; serde_json; thiserror) and src/lib.rs, src/engine.rs, src/limits.rs, src/script.rs, src/error.rs. Define the Limits struct with the documented defaults and a Default impl.","cargo build -p agentkit-script succeeds; Limits::default() matches the documented values; the crate has no dependency on agentkit-switchboard.",low,1-2h,,"engine-library, resource-limits"
  T-002,[x] Build the sandboxed engine and compile scripts,"Implement ScriptEngine::new, with_limits, limits, compile, and compile_file. Construct the engine with Engine::new_raw plus StandardPackage (no FileModuleResolver), register no host functions, disable eval/import/export, and apply every Limits value via set_max_operations, set_max_call_levels, set_max_expr_depths, set_max_string_size, set_max_array_size, set_max_map_size, and set_max_strings_interned. compile_file reads the file and reports Read or Compile errors with the origin.","A script compiles; a missing file yields Read; a syntax error yields Compile; eval and import are rejected at compile time; ScriptEngine is Send + Sync.",medium,2-3h,T-001,"sandboxed-engine, no-host-capabilities, self-contained-scripts, startup-compilation, engine-library"
  T-003,[x] Implement call with conversion and timeout,"Implement ScriptEngine::call. Check defines(function, 1) first and return MissingFunction otherwise. Convert the JSON input with rhai::serde::to_dynamic, run engine.call_fn::<Dynamic> with a fresh Scope and a thread_local wall-clock deadline checked from on_progress, then flatten and convert back with rhai::serde::from_dynamic. Map Rhai errors and termination tokens to ScriptError variants.","A script returning a map round-trips through JSON; a missing function yields MissingFunction; a non-map return yields InvalidReturn; an infinite loop terminates as LimitExceeded; a slow script terminates as Timeout.",high,3-4h,T-002,"script-contract, resource-limits, bounded-execution, missing-function, non-map-return, engine-library"
  T-004,[x] Unit test the scripting engine,"Add unit tests in agentkit-script covering compile and call, missing function, runtime error, infinite loop hitting max_operations, string and array and map size limits, eval and import blocked, wall-clock timeout, and non-map return. Assert that no filesystem or network access is possible.","cargo test -p agentkit-script passes; each sandbox and limit behaviour has a dedicated test.",medium,2-3h,T-003,"sandbox-enforced, limits-enforced, missing-function, non-map-return, self-contained-scripts"
  T-005,Change ProviderConfig to mutations,"Remove headers and user_agent from ProviderConfig and add mutations: Vec<PathBuf> with a serde default. Update the loader to resolve relative paths against the config file directory. Reject a config that still supplies the removed fields.","ProviderConfig no longer has headers or user_agent; a config with mutations parses; relative paths resolve against the config directory; a config using the removed fields fails to parse.",medium,2-3h,,"static-config-removal, static-config-removed, mutation-scripts, script-path-resolution"
  T-006,Implement the mutation stage,"Add src/proxy/mutation.rs with MutationSet and apply. Build the request object map from provider identity, surface, model, session_id, headers, and the parsed body; call each compiled script in order; read back headers and body; validate header names and values; serialise the body. Return a MutationError on any failure.","A script that sets a header and adds tools is reflected in the returned headers and body; two scripts run in order; an invalid header fails; a non-JSON body is passed as unit.",high,3-4h,"T-003, T-005","header-mutation, body-mutation, script-contract, read-only-context, failure-semantics, fail-closed, invalid-header, non-json-body, script-ordering"
  T-007,Compile mutations at startup,"Build one ScriptEngine at startup and compile every provider's mutations once into a HashMap<String, MutationSet> held in AppState. Abort startup with the provider identity and origin on a missing file, a parse error, or a script without fn mutate. Compile a shared script path once even when referenced by multiple providers.","Startup fails with a clear error for a bad script; a valid config starts; a provider with no mutations gets an empty set; a shared script compiles once.",medium,2-3h,"T-005, T-006","startup-compilation, mutation-scripts, script-path-resolution, shared-script, empty-mutation-list"
  T-008,Integrate mutations into the forwarder and remove the hack,"Replace ForwardRequest's provider_user_agent and provider_headers with mutations: Option<&MutationSet> and a surface. In forward_request, assemble out_headers, call MutationSet::apply, then inject credentials last. Delete the hardcoded tools and tool_choice rewrite and the unconditional body mutation from routes.rs.","Mutations run per provider attempt before credential injection; credentials always win; routes.rs contains no hardcoded tools or tool_choice; no mutations preserves passthrough.",high,3-4h,"T-006, T-007","pipeline-placement, credential-isolation, tools-emulation, hack-removed, empty-mutation-list, no-session-id"
  T-009,Switchboard mutation integration tests,"Add tests for header mutation reaching upstream, body tools mutation reaching upstream via a fixture script under tests/fixtures/mutations/, script ordering, invalid header failing the request, fail-closed on script error, credential isolation, and no-mutation passthrough. Replace proxy_request_body_tools_always_injected with a provider-scoped mutation test.","cargo test -p agentkit-switchboard passes; the removed hack test is replaced; each acceptance criterion has a test.",medium,3-4h,T-008,"script-header, script-body, hack-removed, fail-closed-accepted, credential-isolation-accepted, script-ordering, invalid-header, non-json-body, empty-mutation-list"
  T-010,Update docs and run quality gates,"Remove the stale custom-headers documentation and document the mutations field and the fn mutate contract. Run cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings and cargo test across the workspace.","No docs describe [providers.headers] or user_agent; the mutations field and script contract are documented; clippy -D warnings is clean; the full test suite passes.",low,1-2h,"T-008, T-009","quality-gates, static-config-removal, mutation-scripts, script-contract"
